    "title": {
      "en": "Uldaman Boss Drops Loot Again But Item Vendor Price Nerfed",
      "es": "El jefe de Uldaman vuelve a soltar botín, pero se ha reducido el precio de venta de los objetos"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Uldaman Boss Drops Loot Again But Item Vendor Price Nerfed...",
      "es": "El jefe de Uldaman vuelve a soltar botín, pero se ha reducido el precio de venta de los objetos..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6b051218a1b6a6.89410583\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">The Obsidian Golem boss in Uldaman drops loot again, but the vendor cost of the items has been nerfed.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/uldaman-dungeon-overview-location-rewards\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Uldaman Dungeon</span></a></div><br><br>In the last couple of days, <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/uldaman-boss-no-longer-drops-loot-nerf-targets-gold-farming-strategy-383955\" data-contiguous=\"true\">Blizzard hotfixed</a> the <a data-entity=\"npc\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/npc=7023/obsidian-sentinel\"><span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Obsidian Sentinel</span></a> boss in Uldaman to remove all <span class=\"q3\">Rare Drops</span> from the loot table. This was likely due to max-level players being able to kill this boss and zone out in about 90 seconds, obtaining an average of <span class=\"moneygold\">1</span> <span class=\"moneysilver\">77</span> per run from vendoring the gear. At the previous cap of 10 dungeons per hour, this would be about 18 gold for 15 minutes of work. <br><br>In new hotfixes today, the loot from the Uldaman boss has returned, but the vendor price has been slashed by 50%.<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units\" data-type=\"user\" data-has-source=\"false\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><ul class=\"first last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><a class=\"q3 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=274430/rock-sentinel-slicer\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Rock Sentinel Slicer\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_04.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Rock Sentinel Slicer</span></a> sells for <span class=\"moneygold\">1</span> <span class=\"moneysilver\">7</span> <span class=\"moneycopper\">84</span> (was <span class=\"moneygold\">2</span> <span class=\"moneysilver\">15</span> <span class=\"moneycopper\">68</span>)</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><a class=\"q3 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=274428/dark-golem-breastplate\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Dark Golem Breastplate\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate10.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Dark Golem Breastplate</span></a> sells for <span class=\"moneysilver\">59</span> <span class=\"moneycopper\">93</span> (was <span class=\"moneygold\">1</span> <span class=\"moneysilver\">19</span> <span class=\"moneycopper\">86</span>)</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><a class=\"q3 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=274425/white-obsidian-wand\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"White Obsidian Wand\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_07.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">White Obsidian Wand</span></a> sells for <span class=\"moneysilver\">68</span> <span class=\"moneycopper\">44</span> (was <span class=\"moneygold\">1</span> <span class=\"moneysilver\">36</span> <span class=\"moneycopper\">87</span>)</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><a class=\"q3 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=274485/axe-of-lingering-dread\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Axe of Lingering Dread\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_01.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Axe of Lingering Dread</span></a> sells for <span class=\"moneygold\">1</span> <span class=\"moneysilver\">17</span> (was <span class=\"moneygold\">2</span> <span class=\"moneysilver\">34</span>)</div></li></ul></div></div>This change, combined with the <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/maximum-dungeons-per-hour-reduced-in-wow-forever-hotfix-solo-gold-farming-nerf-383950\" data-contiguous=\"true\">new cap of 5 dungeons per hour</a>, now leads to an average of about 4.42 gold for 7.5 minutes of work from vendoring the items.<br><br>The good news is that for leveling characters, the loot is back and players can once again get <a class=\"q3 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=9425/pendulum-of-doom\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Pendulum of Doom\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_halberd_08.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Pendulum of Doom</span></a> for their leveling journey.</div>\n            \n            <noscript>The Obsidian Golem boss in Uldaman drops loot again, but the vendor cost of the items has been nerfed.<br /><br />Uldaman Dungeon<br /><br />In the last couple of days, <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/uldaman-boss-no-longer-drops-loot-nerf-targets-gold-farming-strategy-383955\">Blizzard hotfixed</a> the <a href=\"/forever/npc=7023/obsidian-sentinel\">Obsidian Sentinel</a> boss in Uldaman to remove all Rare Drops from the loot table. This was likely due to max-level players being able to kill this boss and zone out in about 90 seconds, obtaining an average of per run from vendoring the gear. At the previous cap of 10 dungeons per hour, this would be about 18 gold for 15 minutes of work. <br /><br />In new hotfixes today, the loot from the Uldaman boss has returned, but the vendor price has been slashed by 50%. <br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\"><ul><li><a href=\"/forever/item=274430/rock-sentinel-slicer\">Rock Sentinel Slicer</a> sells for (was )</li><li><a href=\"/forever/item=274428/dark-golem-breastplate\">Dark Golem Breastplate</a> sells for (was )</li><li><a href=\"/forever/item=274425/white-obsidian-wand\">White Obsidian Wand</a> sells for (was )</li><li><a href=\"/forever/item=274485/axe-of-lingering-dread\">Axe of Lingering Dread</a> sells for (was )</li></ul></div><br /><br />This change, combined with the <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/maximum-dungeons-per-hour-reduced-in-wow-forever-hotfix-solo-gold-farming-nerf-383950\">new cap of 5 dungeons per hour</a>, now leads to an average of about 4.42 gold for 7.5 minutes of work from vendoring the items.<br /><br />The good news is that for leveling characters, the loot is back and players can once again get <a href=\"/forever/item=9425/pendulum-of-doom\">Pendulum of Doom</a> for their leveling journey.</noscript>            \n        ",
