    "title": {
      "en": "Blizzard Working on a Fix for Paladin and Warlocks Not Unlocking Epic Riding",
      "es": "Blizzard está trabajando en una solución para que los Paladínes y los brujos puedan desbloquear las monturas épicas"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Blizzard Working on a Fix for Paladin and Warlocks Not Unlocking Epic Riding...",
      "es": "Blizzard está trabajando en una solución para que los Paladínes y los brujos puedan desbloquear las monturas épicas..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6b05129faf4c63.48070198\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard is working on a fix for Paladins and Warlocks not unlocking Epic Riding by completing the class quest.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/unlocking-riding-skill-mounts\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Riding Skill Guide</span></a></div><br><br>Blizzard has acknowledged a bug where Paladins and Warlocks are not unlocking Epic Riding skill when completing the questline. This prevents them from using other mounts, such as the  <a class=\"q4 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=280544/cerulean-prideclaw\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Cerulean Prideclaw\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_catskybornemount_c60_blue.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Cerulean Prideclaw</span></a>.<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://eu.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/642667/11\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">We’ve found the bug here, and we think it’s affecting both Paladins and Warlocks.<br><br>We’re working on a fix, but the fix is going to take another day or two.<br><br>Thank you very much for your patience. We’ll get it fixed ASAP.</div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard is working on a fix for Paladins and Warlocks not unlocking Epic Riding by completing the class quest.<br /><br />Riding Skill Guide<br /><br />Blizzard has acknowledged a bug where Paladins and Warlocks are not unlocking Epic Riding skill when completing the questline. This prevents them from using other mounts, such as the <a href=\"/forever/item=280544/cerulean-prideclaw\">Cerulean Prideclaw</a>. <br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\">We’ve found the bug here, and we think it’s affecting both Paladins and Warlocks.<br /><br />We’re working on a fix, but the fix is going to take another day or two.<br /><br />Thank you very much for your patience. We’ll get it fixed ASAP.</div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
    "imageUrl": "https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/blog/images/56215-blizzard-working-on-a-fix-for-paladin-and-warlocks-not-getting-epic-riding.jpg",
